[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2585157\">7040L40</a></p>"],[63,7,1024,"<p><a href=\"#/2585158\">7040L44</a></p>"],[63,7,1024,"<p>1. Prise the seal (1a) from its seating, starting from the join\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2023321.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the seal has no\ncuts or cracks.</p><p>If it has, replace the seal.</p><p>1. Fit the seal (1a) in its seating, starting from the top corner\n(1b) and positioning the reference mark (1c) on the seal at the\ncentre of the corner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2023322.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Check that the seal adheres\nperfectly to the bodywork flange.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585157\">7040L40</a></p>"],[63,7,1024,"<p><a href=\"#/2585158\">7040L44</a></p>"]]